 class="s35">•</span><span class="s36"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;гематома</span></p><p class="s37"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s36"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;камни</span></p><p class="s37"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s36"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;отложение солей</span></p><p class="s37"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s36"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;иммунные комплексы &nbsp;</span></p><p class="s21"> </p></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
