</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s14"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:642; width:78; height:540; background-image:url(x-apple-ql-id://3D608309-28A4-4583-A0BE-C4C273454DC9/x-apple-ql-magic/699572DF-FEA5-442F-BBA7-51E3A0F4D783.jpg);"><div class="s15"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:25; left:36; width:570; height:90;"><div class="s22"><div class="s4"><p class="s23"><span class="s131">Отличия экссудата от транссудата</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:167; left:31; width:570; height:381;"><div class="s10"><p class="s16"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Образуется в условиях повышенной сосудистой проницаемости</span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Содержит большое количество белка </span><span class="s133"><span class="s134"> </span><span class="s135">имеет высокую плотность</span></span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Содержит большое количество форменных элементов, преимущественно лейкоцитов</span></p><p class="s21"> </p></div></div></div><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s14"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:642; width:78; height:540; background-image:url(x-apple-ql-id://3D608309-28A4-4583-A0BE-C4C273454DC9/x-apple-ql-magic/699572DF-FEA5-442F-BBA7-51E3A0F4D783.jpg);"><div class="s15"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"> </p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:25; left:36; width:570; height:90;"><div class="s22"><div class="s4"><p class="s23"><span class="s51">Виды экссудатов</span></p></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute; top:126; left:36; width:284; height:239;"><div class="s10"><p class="s16"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Серозный</span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Фибринозный</span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Гнойный</span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Гнилостный</span></p><p class="s21"><span class="s35">•</span><span class="s132">Геморрагический</span></p><p class="s19"> </p></div></div><img src="x-apple-ql-id://D80A19AC-5249-4DAA-B46F-606CDC931F2F/x-apple-ql-magic/98F97B57-3322-41CE-AA86-717F9F8BD90C.png" style="position:absolute; top:326; left:178; width:455; height:202;"></div><style type="text/css">
.s136.s136.s136 {color:#581f4d; text-transform:uppercase; font-size:24; font-family:"Times New Roman";}
.s137.s137.s137 {color:#000000; font-weight:bold; font-size:28; font-family:"Times New Roman";}
